      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4fd60ede2af4b908e3062021_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "As you type in a text note, certain character sequences are replaced with the typographic symbol they represent. Typing __TRILIUM_PH_0__ gives you __TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__ gives you __TRILIUM_PH_3__, and __TRILIUM_PH_4__ gives you __TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "4fd60ede2af4b908e3062021ed88a543abfb27cd9d8ae7f755c3af272a1d9f02",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements",
      "contextHash": "48ab566f00f271239a67b01196e00420954564d9113f2c7b421d03d0d9a2610d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eb6f07435dac20befcd94f3a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "These replacements are not applied inside code blocks or inline code, and pasted text is never affected, only text you type. If you have pasted a code snippet, or written one inside a code block, its characters are left exactly as they are.",
      "sourceHash": "eb6f07435dac20befcd94f3acc4b06c16273840e51d9753966122cf4927a0fab",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements",
      "contextHash": "48ab566f00f271239a67b01196e00420954564d9113f2c7b421d03d0d9a2610d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_adf2a9b1620efb79f9cd582f_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Undoing a replacement__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "adf2a9b1620efb79f9cd582f81d81f7d4b1b48d78e508f930984e9d2d93f5dc6",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements > Undoing a replacement",
      "contextHash": "778a1cf3d36ab6a24282d185c1acf8e5e44e239a08446337a78f4a6e68c8d906",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_85a8935e3cbf9b5b9d80c0e2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once an automatic replacement takes place, it can be undone by:",
      "sourceHash": "85a8935e3cbf9b5b9d80c0e226f1aeddd3559236b29370f78fd4fa81e19f5d0d",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements > Undoing a replacement",
      "contextHash": "778a1cf3d36ab6a24282d185c1acf8e5e44e239a08446337a78f4a6e68c8d906",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7112db93d7f91fd40062611b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Backspace__TRILIUM_PH_1__ immediately after a replacement undoes it and restores what you typed.",
      "sourceHash": "7112db93d7f91fd40062611b74a352ef0e7d85eef34739df1b8505ebe4de1f89",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements > Undoing a replacement",
      "contextHash": "778a1cf3d36ab6a24282d185c1acf8e5e44e239a08446337a78f4a6e68c8d906",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d5395b6ccfb6fe653c279535_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Note that this consumes the undo, so a further __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Z__TRILIUM_PH_3__ might delete your typed text.",
      "sourceHash": "d5395b6ccfb6fe653c279535e676243756a188e3c9dcbbcb82cfcf769e0d7b95",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements > Undoing a replacement",
      "contextHash": "778a1cf3d36ab6a24282d185c1acf8e5e44e239a08446337a78f4a6e68c8d906",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cc807d4d5f2272310972d287_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Space__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or changing the cursor position disables this functionality.",
      "sourceHash": "cc807d4d5f2272310972d28794987a77cff3b8ffb221150c75d6a9d8df64a080",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements > Undoing a replacement",
      "contextHash": "778a1cf3d36ab6a24282d185c1acf8e5e44e239a08446337a78f4a6e68c8d906",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_520e31cc0c35ad2f63cc33b5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Z__TRILIUM_PH_3__, which works even after pressing space.",
      "sourceHash": "520e31cc0c35ad2f63cc33b5981b42d7560153d4bc9330f24c598fb419d53981",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Automatic replacements > Undoing a replacement",
      "contextHash": "778a1cf3d36ab6a24282d185c1acf8e5e44e239a08446337a78f4a6e68c8d906",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
