    {
      "id": "u_4e4abf6edb1fd9168794356d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Quotation marks are configured separately from the rest, with one setting for the __TRILIUM_PH_0__double__TRILIUM_PH_1__ quote key and one for the __TRILIUM_PH_2__single__TRILIUM_PH_3__ quote key, because which pair belongs on which key differs between conventions: British typography traditionally sets a quotation in __TRILIUM_PH_4__ where American sets it in __TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "4e4abf6edb1fd9168794356d6da51b7c89263d310dd937a99347be16118670e4",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Quotation marks",
      "contextHash": "8e6b81f27664f5cd9a6dd9b18ea56e2f856c2b38ec3dba09e0379ce6f764ac63",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2cc84c2c4e8da966b405daa5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Each offers:",
      "sourceHash": "2cc84c2c4e8da966b405daa585061fdc423cbdffb430800bfb9e23a3ffeee4a7",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Quotation marks",
      "contextHash": "8e6b81f27664f5cd9a6dd9b18ea56e2f856c2b38ec3dba09e0379ce6f764ac63",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_21cf54d82dc375948a5709f5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Based on the note's content language__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (the default) — English gives __TRILIUM_PH_2__, German __TRILIUM_PH_3__, French __TRILIUM_PH_4__, Japanese __TRILIUM_PH_5__. See __TRILIUM_PH_6__Content language & Right-to-left support__TRILIUM_PH_7__ for how a note's language is decided.",
      "sourceHash": "21cf54d82dc375948a5709f5d9959bc526cb3e816e8aaf858279d576b468d273",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Quotation marks",
      "contextHash": "8e6b81f27664f5cd9a6dd9b18ea56e2f856c2b38ec3dba09e0379ce6f764ac63",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b2120403fbe9e7daf8c7624d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Disabled,__TRILIUM_PH_1__ straight quotes stay straight.",
      "sourceHash": "b2120403fbe9e7daf8c7624d97b86bca7d2f6bf21339dda80858edcd31a1a06d",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Quotation marks",
      "contextHash": "8e6b81f27664f5cd9a6dd9b18ea56e2f856c2b38ec3dba09e0379ce6f764ac63",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f2132bb8df039d10d5dbbd8a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A specific pair_:_ __TRILIUM_PH_0__, __TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__, __TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__, __TRILIUM_PH_5__, __TRILIUM_PH_6__, __TRILIUM_PH_7__, __TRILIUM_PH_8__. Choosing one applies it to every note, regardless of its content language.",
      "sourceHash": "f2132bb8df039d10d5dbbd8a637339ad7dc25fc1052d5c00bb73f74a5fe82f2f",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Quotation marks",
      "contextHash": "8e6b81f27664f5cd9a6dd9b18ea56e2f856c2b38ec3dba09e0379ce6f764ac63",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3ce063819fb1a5e394451c9c_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Custom replacements__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "3ce063819fb1a5e394451c9c3fdd9eb56548cd0f602fde09cb51ad9681672a71",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Custom replacements",
      "contextHash": "ebc7d0a0720dc5c0d35bdd448ef4557daa426fc1fc3c1f798a05602140933cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2eeaac429f6ac10e1cb8a0c7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can add your own under __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Text notes__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Automatic replacements__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__Custom replacements__TRILIUM_PH_7__. Type the text to replace and the replacement, then press Enter. Existing ones are shown as chips and removed with the × on each.",
      "sourceHash": "2eeaac429f6ac10e1cb8a0c7d07f278664b40dea7701a61fdeadd2b0711d2dd5",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Custom replacements",
      "contextHash": "ebc7d0a0720dc5c0d35bdd448ef4557daa426fc1fc3c1f798a05602140933cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4641dfdf2e5960fd359e05b7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A custom replacement is applied when the text is typed as a whole word and followed by a space, so longer words that begin with it are left alone — a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ replacement does not rewrite the end of __TRILIUM_PH_1__, and __TRILIUM_PH_2__ can still be typed.",
      "sourceHash": "4641dfdf2e5960fd359e05b78d4b7e1199faf3ff89cf2fe897e9ab250b15f532",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Custom replacements",
      "contextHash": "ebc7d0a0720dc5c0d35bdd448ef4557daa426fc1fc3c1f798a05602140933cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ab6951a125c933e2f67d586e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Capitalization follows what you type, unless the replacement has capitals of its own:",
      "sourceHash": "ab6951a125c933e2f67d586ed3c156afc6ff773bdd877e98ddf912cb6ba73c2f",
      "context": "Automatic replacements > Custom replacements",
      "contextHash": "ebc7d0a0720dc5c0d35bdd448ef4557daa426fc1fc3c1f798a05602140933cdb",
      "status": "pending",
